# Test fixture — small synthetic jurisdiction boundaries (T-G01).
#
# These are NOT the real AU Geoscience polygons; they're a 1-2-polygon
# sample large enough to exercise the STRtree + lookup contract while
# staying small enough to commit. The full AU dataset is loaded at
# runtime via the Bicep deployment of the `jurisdiction-boundaries`
# Storage container.
#
# Format: each pair of non-comment lines is `<jurisdiction_code>` then
# `<WKT polygon>`.
ACT
POLYGON ((148.7 -35.95, 149.4 -35.95, 149.4 -35.1, 148.7 -35.1, 148.7 -35.95))
NSW
POLYGON ((149.5 -37.5, 153.7 -37.5, 153.7 -28.0, 149.5 -28.0, 149.5 -37.5))
